        "date": "2026-11-03",
        "summary": "Now rolling out to Entra tenants is the ability to configure the change password method for user accounts through the My Sign Ins page without knowing the original password. Although many Entra users are going passwordless, that approach only works when applications support passkeys. The need to update someone\u2019s password to allow them to access an application still exists, and the new method allows the user to do it themselves even when they can\u2019t remember their original password.",
